{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Light Here 是一款以時鐘呈現親友所在地時間的世界時鐘工具，利用顏色提示是否適合致電，適合需要跨時區聯絡家人、朋友或同事的使用者。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-273.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>顏色提示最佳通話時機</h2>\n<p>App 支援最多四個地點，並可為每個地點設定可聯絡時段，以金色、珊瑚色與藍色提示是否適合通話。滑動時間軸可同時查看各城市時間，或找出所有人都清醒的下一段時段；亦可加入聯絡人，點按頭像致電、傳訊息、FaceTime、WhatsApp 或 Telegram。它完全離線運作，內置超過 159,000 個城鎮，並提供三種時鐘設計及主畫面、StandBy 與鎖定畫面小工具。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-280-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-281-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-282-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-283-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-284-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Light Here: World Clock</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/light-here-world-clock/id6818939740?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T18:04:19.751694+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":345,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T17:37:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T06:48:34.899536+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T17:57:49.634305+00:00","content_hash":"bf73fb642c488ae3299488d82d8b53b2137fdd6b067c96537b2e4adfbd33a0a0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}